{
  "info": {
    "name": "Marazul - HU29 Frota",
    "description": "Cobertura dos criterios de aceitacao da HU29 (Epico 11 - Gestao de Frota).\n\nComo usar:\n1. Suba a aplicacao (mvnw spring-boot:run) com o MySQL 'marazul' no ar.\n2. Importe esta collection no Postman.\n3. Rode pelo Collection Runner, na ordem em que os requests estao.\n\nA collection e re-executavel: a placa e o prefixo sao sorteados a cada rodada,\ne o cadastro de usuario aceita 201 (primeira vez) ou 409 (ja existente).\n\nO token JWT e capturado no login e reaproveitado automaticamente nos demais requests.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{token}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:8080",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "email",
      "value": "admin@marazul.com",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "senha",
      "value": "senha123",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "token",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "veiculoId",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "placa",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "placaMinuscula",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "prefixo",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "placaComHifen",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "placaAntiga",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Autenticacao",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "1.1 Register - cria usuario admin",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Aceita 201 (novo) ou 409 (ja cadastrado)', function () {",
                  "    pm.expect([201, 409]).to.include(pm.response.code);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"nome\": \"Admin Postman\",\n  \"email\": \"{{email}}\",\n  \"senha\": \"{{senha}}\",\n  \"position\": \"DRIVER\",\n  \"userRole\": \"ADMIN\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
